#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Alpha Team, from its boot to its Select Adventure screen with an
# adventure saved in the first of its six slots, which the screen labels with
# the mission it is at and the date it was saved on (#87). That date is
# `KERNEL32!GetDateFormatA`'s, and the time the title asks for beside it
# `GetTimeFormatA`'s.
#
# The pointer arithmetic is menu.route's: every move is where the hand got to
# in a window the title puts the pointer back in the middle of, and the title
# takes a 1280th of the window for each pixel of that, half a pixel across and
# three eighths of one down. The pointer starts in the bottom left corner.
#
# The machine starts with nothing saved, so this saves something first: a new
# adventure, its training mission skipped, and back to HQ. Every click waits
# for the slower of the two declared refresh rates this title is run at, the
# test suite's sixty and the title's own thirty, and every screen it clicks on
# waits for it.
flip 1792 key Space down
flip 1794 key Space up
# Onto Adventure, the main menu's first item, and in.
flip 2232 move 480 9
flip 2234 move 480 9
flip 2236 move 480 9
flip 2238 move 480 9
flip 2252 down
flip 2254 up
# Select Adventure, all six slots New: the first one.
flip 2332 move 46 219
flip 2352 down
flip 2354 up
# The Adventure Briefing pages itself; its X, bottom right, starts the
# adventure at the Alpha Team Training Area.
flip 2432 move 523 433
flip 2434 move 523 433
flip 2436 move 523 433
flip 2452 down
flip 2454 up
# A click begins the training exercise, and the round button at the bottom
# left opens the menu inside a mission.
flip 2760 down
flip 2762 up
flip 2800 move 36 320
flip 2802 move 36 320
flip 2804 move 36 320
flip 2842 down
flip 2844 up
# Skip Training Mission. This is what writes the slot into Game.txt, at
# Mission One, which then loads.
flip 2920 move 492 20
flip 2922 move 492 20
flip 2924 move 492 20
flip 2942 down
flip 2944 up
# Back to the bottom left button: the first click begins Mission One, the
# second opens its menu.
flip 3540 move 148 460
flip 3542 move 148 460
flip 3544 move 148 460
flip 3562 down
flip 3564 up
flip 3642 down
flip 3644 up
# Return to HQ, which is the main menu again.
flip 3720 move 578 17
flip 3722 move 578 17
flip 3740 down
flip 3742 up
# And Adventure once more. The first slot now reads Mission One, and under it
# the date: 10/29/99.
flip 4060 move 320 64
flip 4062 move 320 64
flip 4080 down
flip 4082 up
